You pay for your lunch at the kiosk with your card. {{1}}
You save CHF 20 every month for a new snowboard. {{2}}
You work out that the concert ticket costs as much as three trips to the cinema. {{3}}
The bakery pays its employee her wages at the end of the month. {{4}}
Your grandparents have put money aside for your education. {{5}}
In the shop, you compare the prices of two phones. {{6}}
You buy a train ticket from the ticket machine. {{7}}
The club sets aside the takings from the cake sale for next year's camp. {{8}}
The newspaper says a second-hand car is “worth CHF 8000”. {{9}}
